%96%E7%95%8C%E4%BB%BB%E6%88%91%E9%97%AF.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f7/flygc1qe0shj556d7t2pcgi4xoil1dv.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E4%BB%BB%E6%88%91%E9%97%AF.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f7/flygc1qe0shj556d7t2pcgi4xoil1dv.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />世界任我闯\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（领袖光环）场上所有阵营为&lt;漂泊者&gt;的己方，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，防御提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。主动攻击和反击时，每命中1名目标，造成伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>，最多<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。若目标处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"受伤\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">受伤</font></span></span>]状态，暴击率、暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%BB%8E%E5%90%84\" title=\"角色图鉴库/黎各\"><img alt=\"头像 黎各.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/50/g7oyfmhkv95nz1i4nhnv75z7rgcz678.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">黎各</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br /